 actions: Open attachment and add flight to calendar; forward to travel organizer or assistant if you want them to handle logistics.\n\nWhat would you like me to do next?\n- Reply to Alice confirming attendance (I can send it now).\n- Reply to Tim to propose times (I can send it now).\n- Forward the Swissair confirmation to someone (tell me the address and any note).\n- Save/draft/mark any of these emails (specify which).\n- Or anything else.\n\nIf you want me to reply or forward, tell me which email (you can use the quick suggestions above) and I’ll send it.",
